1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,458
Exactly.

2
00:00:01,458 --> 00:00:02,166
The Godfather,

3
00:00:02,708 --> 00:00:04,125
the man behind more legends

4
00:00:04,125 --> 00:00:06,083
than any other on this continent.

5
00:00:06,083 --> 00:00:08,708
He's the only one
who can save us now.

6
00:00:08,708 --> 00:00:10,625
If he decides to step in,

7
00:00:10,625 --> 00:00:12,625
the Black Dragon Covenant
wouldn't last a week.

8
00:00:12,625 --> 00:00:14,583
But he disappeared years ago.

9
00:00:14,708 --> 00:00:16,291
No one knows
where to find him.

10
00:00:16,291 --> 00:00:17,833
And say we track him down…

11
00:00:17,833 --> 00:00:20,000
why would he give
a damn about us?

12
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,416
We're nothing to him.

13
00:00:22,125 --> 00:00:25,833
Because if we don't,
everyone on this continent dies.

14
00:00:26,416 --> 00:00:29,958
Even a ghost of
a chance is worth chasing.

15
00:00:31,458 --> 00:00:33,041
I've heard the
Godfather is still unwed.

16
00:00:33,041 --> 00:00:34,041
Elowen, you are the most

17
00:00:34,041 --> 00:00:35,500
beautiful woman on Golantis.

18
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:38,416
The Morellan's survival… it
all rests on you now.

19
00:00:38,416 --> 00:00:41,208
I'll do whatever it
takes for this family.

20
00:00:41,666 --> 00:00:42,958
And a man like that?

21
00:00:42,958 --> 00:00:45,000
I'd like to
offer myself to him.

22
00:00:45,625 --> 00:00:48,333
But… where do we find him?

23
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:52,541
I know where he is.

24
00:00:55,666 --> 00:00:58,958
Severin, man, with a face like that,

25
00:00:58,958 --> 00:01:00,541
you could be charming noble girls

26
00:01:00,541 --> 00:01:02,041
instead of eating dirt with us.

27
00:01:02,541 --> 00:01:04,166
Those noble girls?

28
00:01:05,041 --> 00:01:06,083
I could have a hundred.

29
00:01:06,083 --> 00:01:07,875
But that life, it's empty.

30
00:01:08,375 --> 00:01:09,583
I got tired of it.

31
00:01:11,083 --> 00:01:12,125
Don't believe me?

32
00:01:12,125 --> 00:01:13,250
Pick any girl you want.

33
00:01:13,458 --> 00:01:15,000
Or name whatever you desire.

34
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:16,875
I'll make it real for you.

35
00:01:17,916 --> 00:01:19,500
I can take someone from nothing

36
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:20,500
and make them a god.

37
00:01:21,083 --> 00:01:22,250
That's easy for me.

38
00:01:22,583 --> 00:01:24,916
Okay, okay, you've lost it, man.

39
00:01:24,916 --> 00:01:26,750
The dust finally got to you.

40
00:01:28,375 --> 00:01:29,625
I'm not joking.

41
00:01:29,625 --> 00:01:30,791
Just say it.
